Package: com.samcejko.revine
Name: Revine
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Brings the original Vine app (2.5.1) back on iOS 6 with the content of diVine: the Vine archive and new six-second videos, profiles, comments, hashtags, channels and search. Viewing only, no account needed. Install Vine 2.5.1 yourself.
Maintainer: samcejko
Author: samcejko
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 6.0), firmware (<< 7.0)
Conflicts: bag.xml.vineredirect
